category: Libs
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6
sdesc: "Lightweight Japanese morphological analyzer (runtime)"
ldesc: "Suzume is a lightweight Japanese tokenizer that returns
part-of-speech tags and lemmas, with the dictionaries built in. It provides a C
ABI shared library, a header-only C++ wrapper and a developer command-line
tool."
external-source: suzume

